openage is a volunteer project to create a free engine clone of the Genie
Engine used by Age of Empires, Age of Empires II and Star Wars: Galactic
Battlegrounds.

It uses the original game assets (such as sounds and graphics), but does
not ship them, so one of the original games is required to play.  The
engine core is written in C++20, with Python 3 scripting and media
conversion, a Cython glue layer and a Qt6 based graphical interface.
